  "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
  "label": "The text 'when you are that ugly' maps onto the UglyDolls characters",
  "description": "The top text 'when you are that ugly' is juxtaposed with the visual material of the UglyDolls characters, who are intentionally designed to be visually unattractive. This creates an analogical mapping where the characters are mapped as the embodiment of 'ugly' as described in the text. The meme uses this mapping to imply that the characters' appearance is a defining, burdensome condition, reinforcing the stereotype that ugliness removes one's choice or agency.",
